&lt;tr style="height:14.3pt;min-height:14.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9.1pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.1pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;連結貸借対照表に計上された負債と資産の純額&lt;/p&gt;
